findings.evidence:
The live cup shootout builds both sides from the club lineup (src/client/competitions.ts:359 penaltySide(s.club.name, s.squad, s.lineup)), not from the finished MatchState. As a result:
- a player sent off in the drawn tie takes a kick;
- a sent-off keeper still keeps goal (xi[0]);
- the larger side is not cut down to match the other's numbers.

In src/meta/shootout.ts, takers are only the 10 outfielders, and nextTurn (line 235) cycles takers[round % 10]. The keeper never kicks, and the best shooter kicks a second time before the keeper has kicked once. shoot.ts: 60 of 3000 equal shootouts reached an 11th kick that reused a taker.
